{
 "rm1440": "GENACTIV · POLISH COLOSTRUM BRAND | GENACTIV turned its box into a daily ritual. | GENACTIV, a Polish colostrum brand, gives its customers an app: confirm the purchase, scratch one card a day, collect rewards known in advance. | GENACTIV | Today's card | Rewards | GENACTIV | Example screen, not a screenshot of the app. | THE PROBLEM | Customers stop halfway through the pack. | The daily habit fades mid-month, and the second order does not come. | This month | 15 | of 30 days | Next order | none | Example screen, not a screenshot of the app. | STEP 1 · PROOF OF PURCHASE | Purchase proof from any shop. | The customer scans the code on the box or the shop receipt. The receipt stays on the phone. | Confirm purchase | Stays on this phone | Example screen, not a screenshot of the app. | STEP 2 · CARD OF THE DAY | One card a day, after the daily dose. | The foil is in GENACTIV colours. Scratch it with a finger or a mouse. | Reveal without scratching | Today | Card not scratched yet | Example screen, not a screenshot of the app. | STEP 3 · THE MONTH | Rewards are set before day one. | Every ticked day fills the ring. The stamp lands on a day the customer knew in advance, never by chance. | This month | 30 | of 30 days | STAMP | Day 24 | stamp | Example screen, not a screenshot of the app. | See it with your brand →",
